parmetis
------------------------------------------
ParMETIS is an MPI-based parallel library that implements a variety of
algorithms for partitioning unstructured graphs, meshes, and for computing
fill-reducing orderings of sparse matrices.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgklib0-5.1.1-1+git8bd6bad
  libmetis0-5.2.1-1
  libopenmpi40-4.1.6-1
  libparmetis-devel-4.0.3+git20261116-1bl1
  libparmetis4.0-4.0.3+git20261116-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libgklib-devel-5.1.1-1+git8bd6bad
  libmetis-devel-5.2.1-1
  libopenmpi-devel-4.1.6-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/KarypisLab/ParMETIS

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/KarypisLab/ParMETIS.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack parmetis-4.0.3+git20261116-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./parmetis-4.0.3+git20261116-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/parmetis-4.0.3+git20261116-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/parmetis-4.0.3+git20261116-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libparmetis4.0-4.0.3+git20261116-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libparmetis-devel-4.0.3+git20261116-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(parmetis)
  /usr/bin/pm_dglpart.exe
  /usr/bin/pm_mtest.exe
  /usr/bin/pm_parmetis.exe
  /usr/bin/pm_pometis.exe
  /usr/bin/pm_ptest.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/parmetis.README
  /usr/share/doc/parmetis/Changelog
  /usr/share/doc/parmetis/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/parmetis/README.md

(libparmetis4.0)
  /usr/bin/cygparmetis-4.0.dll

(libparmetis-devel)
  /usr/include/parmetis.h
  /usr/lib/libparmetis.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/parmetis.pc

